### Create a credit
POST http://localhost:8000/credits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "u_123",
  "amount": 50
}

### Check the user
GET http://localhost:8000/users/u_123

### Try posting a negative credit
POST http://localhost:8000/credits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "u_abc",
  "amount": -450
}

### Check the user
GET http://localhost:8000/users/u_abc


### check metrics
GET http://localhost:8000/metrics